* ------------------------------------------------------------
SET LANGUAGE it
ECHO --- it : localized command USAGE sweep ---
ROLLBACK USAGE
DELETE USAGE
RECALL USAGE
ERASE USAGE
IMPORT USAGE
EXPORT USAGE
CREATE USAGE
ZAP USAGE
